    <dataTable>
      <entityName>sample</entityName>
      <entityDescription>One row per physical sampling event at its native grain (site, tow, net, cast, bottle, underway, transect, region pool). An adjacency list: parent_sample_key points at the containing event and root_sample_key at the top of the chain, so counting distinct events at any level is a single GROUP BY.</entityDescription>
