          <attributeLabel>Site Key</attributeLabel>
          <attributeDefinition>CalCOFI station natural key as the source records it (line/station, e.g. 090.0 060.0). Present on 13 of the 18 source event tables, so it is carried on the event dimension rather than lost to consolidation; grid_key is the derived grid cell, this is the source's own station id.</attributeDefinition>
          <storageType>VARCHAR</storageType>
